    "rationale": "CAR-011's three predeclared secondary control arms form one error-control family, declared here beside the frozen analysis plan's three rather than added to that closed declaration. It draws no alpha from the primary comparison, which retains its full 0.05, because a control-arm result can only restrict release wording and never license a qualification."
